      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, so we're in pre-production for this gritty period drama set in the Bronx around 1975. We're trying to get the vibe right for the background actors and extra scenes. Can you give me a breakdown of what the typical street-level inhabitants would look like and act like back then? We want the characters to feel really authentic to the neighborhood at that time.",
